                  "feedback": "A full obesity evaluation is warranted for any patient with BMI ≥23, any obesity-related complication, or weight gain ≥5 kg in 3 months. By Indian criteria, BMI 24 already exceeds the threshold — no comorbidity is needed to trigger evaluation."
                },
                {
                  "from": 51,
